{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Py6eFes4HF1eDTHzaj8d9u","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"6e8da1b1b5a459933ca78eaabf87713592f5ab61","date":"2026-06-23T17:22:29+05:30","message":"(fix) Update Default Procedure Status Concept (#3412)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"05f99be739478393ec4327bcb1f35126e7323f47","date":"2026-06-04T20:48:01+05:30","message":"(feat) Remove procedure overview widget (#3354)","refs":"","body":"Remove the ProceduresOverview component and its associated extension registration,\nconfiguration option, and test file. The detailed summary view is the primary\nprocedures display going forward.","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"6797e139e35959962c51b4148213d88ccdc94af7","date":"2026-05-26T19:38:03+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5077: Support recording clinical procedures (#3320)","refs":"","body":"* Update pull request branches in CI workflow\n\nRemove main branch restriction from pull requests.\n\n* Remove 'patch/*' branch from CI trigger\n\n* Update CI workflow to include additional branches\n\n* Add esm-patient-procedures-app to patient-chart monorepo\n\n* Refactor the file structure\n\n* Add feat/procedure-history branch to workflow triggers\n\n* Modify E2E test triggers for additional branches\n\nUpdated branch filters for E2E tests on push and pull request events.\n\n* Make concept sources configurable\n\n* Load durations dynamically\n\n* Make the form wider\n\n* Make the duration unit combo box\n\n* Make status a combo box\n\n* (fix) O3-5656: Make submit buttons sticky on procedure history form (#3290)\n\n* Fix: stick the submit buttons in procedure form\n\n* Fix: update procedures-form.workspace.test.tsx to new ComboBox components\n\n* (fix) O3-5657: Various fixes to the procedures form (#3297)\n\n* (fix) O3-5653: Wire body site and status concepts in config schema (#3313)\n\n\n\nCo-authored-by: Jayasanka Weerasinghe <33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Cleanup the file structure\n\n* Migrate to vitest\n\n* Fix the workspace\n\n* Isolate date time component\n\n* Prevent future 'any' types\n\n* Convert all function declarations to arrow functions\n\n* Fix accessibility issues in ConceptSearchField (#15)\n\n* Clear slected concep when changing value\n\n* Re-enable delete button after failed delete\n\nsetIsDeleting(false) was missing from the catch block, leaving\nthe Delete button permanently disabled after a transient error.\nUser had to close and reopen the modal to retry.\n\nAlso updates the test assertion to verify the button is re-enabled\nafter an error so the user can retry without reopening the modal.\n\n* docs: add README for esm-patient-procedures-app\n\n* Add README for esm-patient-procedures-app\n\n* Rename file\n\n* Enable delete button on error\n\n* Rename file\n\n* Add separate pagination configs for overview and detailed view\n\n* Align import order and type placement with O3 coding conventions\n\n* Add unit tests for ConceptSearchField and ProceduresActionMenu (#21)\n\n* Add test cases for procedures form component\n\n* Rename close workspace\n\n* Add translations to zod schema\n\n* Minor cleanups\n\n* Reset workflows\n\n* Remove unused abort controller\n\n* Update routes\n\n* Fix the overvierw URL\n\n* Add backend dependancies\n\n* fix: convert type-only imports to 'import type' syntax in procedures-app\n\nConvert all type-only imports in the procedures-app package to use\nthe 'import type' syntax instead of inline 'type' prefixes. This\nimproves code consistency and clarity.\n\nUpdated files:\n- procedures.resource.ts\n- dashboard.meta.ts\n- components/**/*.tsx\n- workspaces/procedures-form/**/*.tsx\n\nAddressed in PR #3320 review comment.\n\n* Remove selectedConcept from hook, use RHF as UUID source of truth\n\n* Surface hook errors in the UI\n\n* Address remaining PR review comments from denniskigen\n\n* Set date boundaries\n\n* Update config descriptions\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dilan Kavishka <109354298+dilankavishka@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi@openmrs.org>","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"}],"totalCount":3}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2a84106-9760-4246-9f49-0b3af5163179","uuid":"f50c50e7-fd98-48ef-89f8-0bd33650c8c4","timestamp":"2026-10-24T03:51:03.327Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"6e8da1b1b5a459933ca78eaabf87713592f5ab61","date":"2026-06-23T17:22:29+05:30","message":"(fix) Update Default Procedure Status Concept (#3412)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"05f99be739478393ec4327bcb1f35126e7323f47","date":"2026-06-04T20:48:01+05:30","message":"(feat) Remove procedure overview widget (#3354)","refs":"","body":"Remove the ProceduresOverview component and its associated extension registration,\nconfiguration option, and test file. The detailed summary view is the primary\nprocedures display going forward.","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"6797e139e35959962c51b4148213d88ccdc94af7","date":"2026-05-26T19:38:03+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5077: Support recording clinical procedures (#3320)","refs":"","body":"* Update pull request branches in CI workflow\n\nRemove main branch restriction from pull requests.\n\n* Remove 'patch/*' branch from CI trigger\n\n* Update CI workflow to include additional branches\n\n* Add esm-patient-procedures-app to patient-chart monorepo\n\n* Refactor the file structure\n\n* Add feat/procedure-history branch to workflow triggers\n\n* Modify E2E test triggers fo